# Facts of the Haiku budget gate (BudgetRouter.should_run) and of the speculation hit-rate gate (SpeculativeLayer._hit_rate_ok).
# The host folds: tracker.session_pct(), tracker.day_cap_exceeded(), get_feature(feature).priority, hits/(hits+misses). The thresholds are the rules.
CONTRACT unitymcp.budget
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE budget_facts
FACT budget.disabled bool
FACT budget.priority enum=critical,medium,low closed
FACT budget.feature string
FACT budget.dayCapExceeded bool
FACT budget.sessionPct number min=0 max=1000
FACT hit.total number min=0 max=100000000 integer
FACT hit.ratio number min=0 max=1
LINK budget.hitOk hitRateOk
LINK budget.route budgetRoute
INPUT hitRateOk hit.total hit.ratio
INPUT budgetRoute budget.disabled budget.priority budget.feature budget.dayCapExceeded budget.sessionPct hit.total hit.ratio
INPUT budgetRun budget.disabled budget.priority budget.feature budget.dayCapExceeded budget.sessionPct hit.total hit.ratio

